{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "08-title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Workbench V2 查询泳道\n批量加载全省完整范围 → 前端时间轴本地切换",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 2370,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#64748b"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-lane0",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "用户",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 2500,
      "color": "#f59e0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-lane1",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Vue 前端 / Axios",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 2500,
      "color": "#8b5cf6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-lane2",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Spring Boot / XML",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 2500,
      "color": "#3b82f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-lane3",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "MySQL 四表",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 2500,
      "color": "#22c55e"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s0",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "01 进入工作台\n默认 ECMWF / T2M / 演示范围",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#f59e0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "02 字典校验 + 缓存键\n模型 / 要素 / 起止时间\n命中直接到10；未命中到03",
      "x": 655,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#8b5cf6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "03 缓存未命中发一次请求\nGET /api/weather/workbench",
      "x": 655,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#8b5cf6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "04 Controller → WeatherQueryService\n格式、关联、时间范围校验",
      "x": 1275,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#3b82f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "05 ForecastRecordMapper.xml\nselectWorkbenchData",
      "x": 1275,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#3b82f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "06 JOIN 四表 / WHERE\n模型 + 要素 + 时间 + 山东16市\nORDER BY 时间 / cityId",
      "x": 1895,
      "y": 1280,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#22c55e"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "07 组装 WorkbenchVO\nmodel / element / times / records",
      "x": 1275,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#3b82f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "08 最新请求才接收并缓存\n先渲染默认时刻\n完整范围；旧请求不得覆盖",
      "x": 655,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#8b5cf6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "09 拖动时间轴 selectedTime",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#f59e0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "10 本地过滤 records\n同步地图着色 / 图例 / 详情",
      "x": 655,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#8b5cf6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-s10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "11 点击济南 / 青岛\n查看详情 → 携带状态进入趋势",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#f59e0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-local",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "缓存命中直接进入本地过滤\n连续拖动不发 API、不访问数据库\n图层/模型/范围变化才选择缓存或查询",
      "x": 2580,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#8b5cf6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-error",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "异常：400 / 404 / 500\n空匹配：200、空 times/records\n缺测不补零；空范围禁用时间轴\nCRUD 成功清缓存并废弃旧请求",
      "x": 2580,
      "y": 2060,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "#64748b"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-ref",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "课程设计/02-系统设计/03-业务流程设计.md",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 2660,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#64748b"
    }
  ],
